{"meta":{"ui":"checkout","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Build a small checkout in three steps. Step 1, my cart: Espresso beans $24 x1, Ceramic mug $12 x2, Canvas tote $18 x1, with quantities I can change and the subtotal. Step 2, shipping: name, address, city, postcode and email, all required, with a message under a field that is empty or an email without an @. Step 3, payment summary: a choice of Standard delivery ($4, 3 to 5 working days) or Express ($12, next working day) that changes the total, subtotal plus delivery. Then a confirmation with an order number, my name, my email and the total I paid. I can go back a step without losing what I typed.","text":"ChatCard \"Checkout\" \"Step 1 of 3\" icon:\"shopping_bag\" status:\"Cart\"\n  state step=1\n  state qty=[{\"id\":\"beans\",\"name\":\"Espresso beans\",\"price\":24,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":\"mug\",\"name\":\"Ceramic mug\",\"price\":12,\"qty\":2},{\"id\":\"tote\",\"name\":\"Canvas tote\",\"price\":18,\"qty\":1}]\n  state name=\"\"\n  state address=\"\"\n  state city=\"\"\n  state postcode=\"\"\n  state email=\"\"\n  state delivery=\"standard\"\n  state orderNo=\"KB-20417\"\n  state subtotal=sum(qty,x=>x.price*x.qty)\n  if step==1\n    SectionLabel \"Your cart\" \"3 items\"\n    each row in qty\n      CartLine \"{row.name}\" \"Unit ${row.price}\" row.price qty:row.qty -> qty=updateWhere(qty,x=>x.id==row.id,x=>with(x,\"qty\",result))\n    Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\",money(subtotal,\"$\",2)]]\n    ActionButton \"Continue to shipping\" primary icon:\"arrow_forward\" -> step=2\n  if step==2\n    SectionLabel \"Shipping\" \"Step 2 of 3\"\n    InputField \"Full name\" \"Jane Doe\" =name\n    InputField \"Address\" \"1 Main Street\" =address\n    InputField \"City\" \"Springfield\" =city\n    InputField \"Postcode\" \"12345\" =postcode\n    InputField \"Email\" \"you@example.com\" =email error:=(email!=\"\" && !contains(email,\"@\"))?\"Enter a valid email\":(email==\"\"?\"Email is required\":\"\")\n    Row gap:10\n      ActionButton \"Back\" quiet -> step=1\n      ActionButton \"Continue\" primary enabled:=name!=\"\" && address!=\"\" && city!=\"\" && postcode!=\"\" && contains(email,\"@\") -> step=3\n  if step==3\n    SectionLabel \"Delivery\" \"Step 3 of 3\"\n    OptionList \"Delivery method\" =delivery options:[\"standard\",\"express\"] details:[\"3 to 5 working days\",\"Next working day\"] prices:[\"$4.00\",\"$12.00\"] -> delivery=result\n    Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\",money(subtotal,\"$\",2)],[\"Delivery\",money(delivery==\"express\"?12:4,\"$\",2)],[\"Total\",money(subtotal+(delivery==\"express\"?12:4),\"$\",2)]]\n    Row gap:10\n      ActionButton \"Back\" quiet -> step=2\n      ActionButton \"Place order\" primary -> step=4\n  if step==4\n    Receipt \"Order placed\" \"Thanks {name}, a confirmation was sent to {email}.\" code:=orderNo codeLabel:\"Order number\" tone:good icon:\"check\"\n    Details rows:=[[\"Name\",name],[\"Email\",email],[\"Total paid\",money(subtotal+(delivery==\"express\"?12:4),\"$\",2)]]","usage":{"input_tokens":9135,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":985,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":640,"totalMs":4042}}
